221
00:15:00,524 --> 00:15:04,194
nag-improve ka naman na talaga,
pero wag mo 'tong madaliin.

222
00:15:04,278 --> 00:15:06,488
Pwede kang mamatay sa bawat ride. Kuha mo?

223
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:16,582
Magfi-field trip tayo bukas,
para mas lumawak ang competition mo.

224
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:19,627
Maliban kung may plano kang gawin bukas.

225
00:15:19,710 --> 00:15:20,794
Sasama ako sa 'yo.

226
00:15:29,678 --> 00:15:31,263
Salamat sa tulong mo, Pat.

227
00:15:31,347 --> 00:15:33,349
-Wala 'yon, Will. Bye.
-Bye.

228
00:15:41,231 --> 00:15:43,651
Napapadalas ka dito,
nawala ba ang susi ng bahay mo?

229
00:15:43,734 --> 00:15:46,654
Hindi, ang tahimik kasi sa bahay
dahil wala si Hayley.

230
00:15:47,321 --> 00:15:48,447
Siguro miss mo na siya.

231
00:15:48,530 --> 00:15:52,284
Oo, pero magandang opportunity
'tong pag-a-abroad niya this semester.

232
00:15:53,202 --> 00:15:56,497
Nag-e-effort akong maging supportive
kasi mahalaga 'yon sa kanya.

233
00:16:02,294 --> 00:16:05,047
Will, wag kang masyadong harsh kay Papa.

234
00:16:06,215 --> 00:16:07,549
Nag-e-effort din siya.

235
00:16:17,351 --> 00:16:20,771
-Ready ka na ba, champ?
-Noon pa ako ready.

236
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,738
Gusto mo ba 'yang pag-usapan?

237
00:16:35,035 --> 00:16:35,911
Ang alin?

238
00:16:38,455 --> 00:16:41,291
'Yong reason kung ba't
nanonood ka ng Rudy.

239
00:16:41,792 --> 00:16:43,794
Classic movie ang Rudy, 'no.

240
00:16:43,877 --> 00:16:47,965
Oo, classic nga 'yan na pinapanood mo lang
pag may bad practice ka.

241
00:16:48,048 --> 00:16:51,927
Well, mas interesado ako
sa pinagkakaabalahan mo.

242
00:16:53,053 --> 00:16:54,763
Pormado ka yata? Saan ka galing?

243
00:16:55,764 --> 00:17:01,020
Ininvite kami ni Amy
dahil birthday niya at nag-karaoke kami.

244
00:17:01,103 --> 00:17:01,937
Sinong Amy?

245
00:17:03,564 --> 00:17:04,815
Si Amy ng drama club.

246
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:08,318
Ayos 'yon.

247
00:17:08,819 --> 00:17:09,737
Oo nga, eh.

248
00:17:29,381 --> 00:17:32,593
Uy, naisip kong ayusin natin
'yong schedule para sa driving lessons.

249
00:17:37,222 --> 00:17:38,057
Wow.

250
00:17:39,558 --> 00:17:41,268
Naaalala ko 'yang collection na 'yan.

251
00:17:42,978 --> 00:17:47,441
Tinawag 'yan ng Vogue na,
"Simple at natural pero elegante."

252
00:17:48,734 --> 00:17:51,028
Jewels by Angelica Howard.

253
00:17:52,696 --> 00:17:54,073
So, ano'ng ginagawa mo?

254
00:17:55,449 --> 00:17:57,951
Sinuggest ni Grace
na ibenta sa pop-up 'tong mga dress.

255
00:17:59,745 --> 00:18:00,579
Oh.

256
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:04,500
Well, ano sa palagay mo?

257
00:18:06,335 --> 00:18:08,337
Nilista ko 'yong pros at cons.

258
00:18:09,129 --> 00:18:11,632
Valid lahat ng dahilan para ibenta na 'to.

259
00:18:12,257 --> 00:18:15,552
Pero ewan ko ba.

260
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:18,555
Ayos lang kung gusto mong itabi 'to.

261
00:18:18,639 --> 00:18:21,809
Di 'to mga ordinaryong dress.
Art 'to ng mama mo.

262
00:18:22,684 --> 00:18:26,188
Art na dapat sinusuot,
at di tinatambak lang sa kahon.

263
00:18:32,277 --> 00:18:35,030
No'ng di pa celebrities
ang binibihisan ng mama mo,

264
00:18:35,114 --> 00:18:37,658
kami ang binibihisan niya
para sa iba't ibang occasions.

265
00:18:39,034 --> 00:18:42,788
No'ng junior year ako,
may dine-date ako, Brian ang name niya.

266
00:18:42,871 --> 00:18:45,499
Biglang tumawag sa 'kin si Brian no'n,

267
00:18:45,582 --> 00:18:48,085
ang sabi niya,
"Kailangan nating mag-usap."

268
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:51,630
So, gets ko nang makikipag-break na siya.

269
00:18:51,713 --> 00:18:54,758
Alam mo ang ginawa ng mama mo?
Niyaya niya 'kong mag-shopping

270
00:18:54,842 --> 00:18:56,969
at kinumbinsi niya 'kong bilhin 'to.

271
00:19:00,806 --> 00:19:03,475
Halatang may pinapatunayan ka
pag suot mo 'to.

272
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:07,229
Siniguro niyang mafi-feel kong
protektado ako.

273
00:19:08,522 --> 00:19:11,942
"Proteksiyon ang fashion para kayanin mo
ang mga pagsubok sa buhay."

274
00:19:13,277 --> 00:19:15,571
Quote 'yon ni Bill Cunningham
na nasa mesa niya.

275
00:19:16,989 --> 00:19:20,868
Jackie, anuman ang maging desisyon mo,
'yon ang tamang desisyon.

276
00:19:24,913 --> 00:19:28,250
Sure ka bang wala kang gustong itabi dito?

277
00:19:30,127 --> 00:19:30,961
Oo.

278
00:19:33,255 --> 00:19:36,175
Malay mo 'yan 'yong proteksiyong
kailangan ng ibang tao.

279
00:19:45,142 --> 00:19:48,645
NEW BIGHORN IDEAS:
"ITO ANG MGA KAGANAPAN SA SILVER FALLS"

280
00:19:48,729 --> 00:19:52,858
Dahil kailangan natin ng topic sa "Ito
ang Kaganapan sa Silver Falls" section,

281
00:19:52,941 --> 00:19:55,444
naisip kong ilagay dito
'yong town hall last week.

282
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:59,364
Hindi lahat excited
na gawing tourist spot ang Silver Falls.

283
00:20:00,324 --> 00:20:01,283
Ewan ko lang.

284
00:20:02,534 --> 00:20:06,079
Magkakainteres ba
ang high school students sa rantso namin?

285
00:20:06,663 --> 00:20:09,833
Malaking project 'yon
na makakaapekto sa mga tagarito.

286
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:16,632
Okay, 'yong pop-up coverage na lang
ang pag-usapan natin.

287
00:20:17,341 --> 00:20:19,676
Siyempre si Zach sa photography.

288
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:22,554
Sa 'yo ang credits ng article
pero dahil ikaw din ang DJ,

289
00:20:22,638 --> 00:20:24,932
na sobrang naa-appreciate
ng Student Council,

290
00:20:25,015 --> 00:20:27,392
tutulungan kitang mangolekta ng opinions,

291
00:20:27,476 --> 00:20:31,021
quotes, at iba pa tungkol sa main issue.
Ang pagtapyas sa pondo.

292
00:20:31,104 --> 00:20:32,314
Okay.

293
00:20:32,397 --> 00:20:35,692
Itatanong ko rin kay Mr. Duffy
'yong new uniform ng banda

294
00:20:35,776 --> 00:20:37,569
na pinangako nila pero naudlot

295
00:20:37,653 --> 00:20:42,115
at si Ms. Hampton tungkol sa pag-atras
niya sa math Olympiad dahil sa pamasahe.

296
00:20:42,199 --> 00:20:45,702
Basta okay ang school sports,
wala silang pakialam, eh 'no?

297
00:20:45,786 --> 00:20:47,246
Sinabi mo pa.

298
00:20:47,329 --> 00:20:50,123
Di pwedeng puro positive ang isulat.
Maging totoo tayo.

299
00:20:52,709 --> 00:20:54,211
Don't hold back

300
00:20:54,878 --> 00:20:58,674
I want to break free
'Cause it's singing through your body

301
00:20:59,341 --> 00:21:01,927
And I'm carried by the sound

302
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:04,263
Kilala mo rin ang Perfume Genius?

303
00:21:04,972 --> 00:21:08,558
Well, mas sikat sila kesa sa Trash Dolls.

304
00:21:09,184 --> 00:21:10,602
Ano'ng banda 'yon?

305
00:21:14,147 --> 00:21:16,775
-Well…
-Solo artist lang si Perfume Genius.

306
00:21:16,858 --> 00:21:18,986
Banda naman ang Trash Dolls.

307
00:21:19,069 --> 00:21:22,197
Nakita mo, Zach,
sa kanya talaga ako natututo about music.

308
00:21:22,948 --> 00:21:24,116
You're welcome.

309
00:21:27,286 --> 00:21:29,329
Magri-refill ako. Gusto n'yo ba?

310
00:21:29,413 --> 00:21:30,706
-Ayoko.
-Ayoko, thanks.

311
00:21:35,919 --> 00:21:38,213
Parang may nagkaka-crush sa 'yo, ah?

312
00:21:39,381 --> 00:21:40,590
Wala, 'no.

313
00:21:40,674 --> 00:21:43,969
Pareho lang kami trip na music…

314
00:21:44,803 --> 00:21:49,016
Saka kahit crush niya man ako,
masaya akong taken na 'ko.

315
00:21:50,475 --> 00:21:51,727
Dapat lang.

316
00:22:00,861 --> 00:22:01,862
Alex!

317
00:22:01,945 --> 00:22:04,489
Muntik na kitang matamaan.

318
00:22:04,573 --> 00:22:06,575
Gumagaling ka na diyan, ah.

319
00:22:07,326 --> 00:22:10,078
Kung di kita kilala,
aakalain kong sa rantso ka lumaki.

320
00:22:11,621 --> 00:22:12,622
Okay, well,

321
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:14,624
enjoy sa ride.

322
00:22:15,625 --> 00:22:16,835
Salamat.

323
00:22:18,420 --> 00:22:19,379
Sige.

324
00:22:24,092 --> 00:22:25,427
Enjoy sa ride?

325
00:22:36,772 --> 00:22:38,023
Ano'ng nangyari sa 'yo?

326
00:22:39,358 --> 00:22:40,484
Naglinis kasi ako.

327
00:22:42,361 --> 00:22:43,653
Gusto mo ng kape?

328
00:22:43,737 --> 00:22:46,239
Oo, kailangang-kailangan ko niyan.

329
00:22:49,242 --> 00:22:53,246
Nga pala, may kakaiba ka bang
napapansin kay Danny?

330
00:22:55,457 --> 00:22:56,416
Pano'ng kakaiba?

331
00:22:56,917 --> 00:23:01,880
Di ko sure, eh.
May kakaiba bang nangyari no'ng summer?

332
00:23:01,963 --> 00:23:04,341
Kung nag-aalala ka,
ba't di mo siya tanungin?

333
00:23:04,966 --> 00:23:08,845
Ewan ko ba. Akala ko lang siguro 'yon.

334
00:23:21,525 --> 00:23:22,651
Relax…

335
00:23:23,693 --> 00:23:25,654
May dayami ka kasi sa buhok.

336
00:23:30,659 --> 00:23:31,993
Natanggal ko na.

337
00:23:36,540 --> 00:23:37,958
-Hi, Jackie.
-Hi.

338
00:23:38,917 --> 00:23:40,293
Uy, balita?

339
00:23:40,377 --> 00:23:41,211
Ayos lang.

340
00:23:42,546 --> 00:23:45,298
Balita ko, di okay ang practice n'yo?

341
00:23:45,882 --> 00:23:47,843
Mas malala pa.

342
00:23:47,926 --> 00:23:49,719
Gusto mo ba 'yong pag-usapan?

343
00:23:51,346 --> 00:23:54,349
Akala ko tutulungan ako ni Dylan.

344
00:23:55,976 --> 00:23:57,727
Pero kinukontra niya ako palagi.

345
00:23:59,229 --> 00:24:01,565
O baka pulpol na coach lang talaga ako.

346
00:24:01,648 --> 00:24:03,692
Di ka pulpol na coach. Okay?

347
00:24:03,775 --> 00:24:07,404
Ginawa kang assistant coach ni Allen
dahil likas kang leader.

348
00:24:07,487 --> 00:24:08,822
Maalam ka pagdating sa game.

349
00:24:09,406 --> 00:24:12,242
Bago ka pa lang,
so di ka nila agad irerespeto.

350
00:24:12,325 --> 00:24:14,703
Mahirap makuha ang respeto nila
at magpaka-leader

351
00:24:14,786 --> 00:24:17,289
kung mismong starting quarterback
di ako sinusunod.

352
00:24:18,457 --> 00:24:21,751
-Ayokong pumalpak dito.
-Well, magpakatotoo ka lang.

353
00:24:22,461 --> 00:24:24,754
Magtiwala ka sa instincts mo.
Di ka papalpak.

354
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:35,557
Okay, team. Ready na ba tayo?

355
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:37,309
Sa totoo lang, hindi pa.

356
00:24:37,809 --> 00:24:39,895
Di 'yon nakakatulong, Olivia.

357
00:24:39,978 --> 00:24:41,771
Nagsasabi lang ako ng totoo.

358
00:24:41,855 --> 00:24:45,650
Vintage ang sinabi natin
sa mga tao, hindi basura.

359
00:24:46,234 --> 00:24:48,069
May dalawang kahon pa 'ko sa kotse.

360
00:24:48,153 --> 00:24:51,531
Huhulaan ko.
Galing 'yon sa church lost and found, 'no?

361
00:24:51,615 --> 00:24:55,452
Patawa ka, eh 'no? Mga pinaglumaan 'yon
ni Katherine na pinadala ni Jackie.

362
00:24:56,286 --> 00:24:57,787
Teka, asan nga ba si Jackie?

363
00:24:57,871 --> 00:25:00,624
Hi. Nagsama ako ng backup.

364
00:25:01,917 --> 00:25:03,543
Ang gaganda nito!

365
00:25:04,044 --> 00:25:06,379
Imposibleng sa mama ni Cole 'yan.

366
00:25:06,963 --> 00:25:09,216
Actually, mama ko ang nag-design nito.

367
00:25:18,225 --> 00:25:21,269
Jackie, di ako makapaniwalang
ibebenta mo 'yan.

368
00:25:38,870 --> 00:25:39,704
Hi, babe.

369
00:25:41,081 --> 00:25:45,377
Kahapon pa di gumagalaw 'yong bulldozer,
pwede ka nang huminto sa pagbabantay.

370
00:25:46,253 --> 00:25:48,797
Baka hinihintay lang nila akong sumuko?

371
00:25:52,175 --> 00:25:53,134
Saan ka papunta?

372
00:25:53,218 --> 00:25:56,596
Pupunta ako sa clinic
tapos magkikita kami ni Lori mamaya.

373
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:59,224
-Ayos.
-Baka dumaan din ako sa pop-up.

374
00:25:59,307 --> 00:26:01,726
Iche-check ko kung okay lang si Jackie.

375
00:26:01,810 --> 00:26:03,311
Bakit naman hindi?

376
00:26:03,937 --> 00:26:06,982
Napagdesisyunan niya nang ibenta
'yong mga dress ni Angelica.

377
00:26:07,065 --> 00:26:09,442
Well, mabuti 'yon, di ba?

378
00:26:09,526 --> 00:26:10,527
Siguro.

379
00:26:11,611 --> 00:26:14,322
-O baka hindi rin. Di ko sure.
-Malalaman natin.

380
00:26:14,823 --> 00:26:16,283
-Hi, Ma.
-Hi, anak.

381
00:26:17,075 --> 00:26:18,076
Kumusta?

382
00:26:18,159 --> 00:26:19,411
Ayos lang po. Pa?

383
00:26:19,494 --> 00:26:22,455
-William.
-Aayain sana kitang mag-fly-fishing.

384
00:26:23,164 --> 00:26:23,999
Ngayon.

385
00:26:26,209 --> 00:26:29,379
Di pwede. May parating akong dayami,
at o-order pa 'ko ng grains.

386
00:26:29,462 --> 00:26:32,549
Alam naming sasabihin mo 'yan,
so si Lee na ang bahala sa dayami,

387
00:26:32,632 --> 00:26:34,467
at si Danny ang o-order ng grains.

388
00:26:37,971 --> 00:26:39,306
Kailangan mo ng day off.

389
00:26:40,265 --> 00:26:41,266
Pareho kayo.

390
00:26:44,394 --> 00:26:45,228
Sige na.

391
00:26:47,355 --> 00:26:49,316
Well, bakit hindi? Sige.

392
00:26:49,399 --> 00:26:50,233
Ayos.

393
00:26:52,152 --> 00:26:53,695
Walang mangyayari sa rantso.

394
00:27:05,248 --> 00:27:07,208
ILALAAN SA FALL FORMAL ANG KIKITAIN DITO!

395
00:27:46,873 --> 00:27:48,083
Kiley!

396
00:27:48,166 --> 00:27:50,293
Bumili ka ng dress para sa dance.

397
00:27:50,377 --> 00:27:53,880
Bawal sa religion ko ang school dance,
saka may work ako.

398
00:27:56,758 --> 00:27:57,676
Duty calls.

399
00:28:05,558 --> 00:28:07,185
Okay, eto na.

400
00:28:10,397 --> 00:28:11,731
Okay lang ba kayo?

401
00:28:12,607 --> 00:28:15,652
Oo. Salamat sa pagsuporta
sa FSH Student Council.

402
00:28:21,366 --> 00:28:25,787
Jackie, alam kong di mo hinihingi
at kailangan ang opinion ko

403
00:28:25,870 --> 00:28:28,289
pero sasabihin ko pa rin 'to, okay?

404
00:28:30,792 --> 00:28:33,002
Ang strong mo
dahil dinonate mo 'yong mga dress.

405
00:28:34,129 --> 00:28:36,047
Bakit? Materyal lang naman 'yon.

406
00:28:54,607 --> 00:28:57,026
Uy, kailangan mo ba ng tulong?

407
00:28:57,110 --> 00:28:57,986
Kaya ko 'to.

408
00:29:08,955 --> 00:29:10,665
Bakit ba talaga tayo nandito?

409
00:29:11,791 --> 00:29:13,334
Di ka mahilig mag-fly-fishing.

410
00:29:15,295 --> 00:29:17,964
Sang-ayon ka ba talaga
sa guest ranch project?

411
00:29:20,216 --> 00:29:22,886
Kasi lately di tayo nagkakasundo, Pa.

412
00:29:24,304 --> 00:29:27,182
No'ng una sa town hall, tapos sa shed…

413
00:29:27,682 --> 00:29:29,434
Sang-ayon ako, promise.

414
00:29:30,351 --> 00:29:31,186
Kaya lang…

415
00:29:32,437 --> 00:29:35,940
Ayokong dumating 'yong araw
na di ko na makilala ang backyard ko.

416
00:29:36,441 --> 00:29:38,109
Akala mo ba gusto ko 'yon?

417
00:29:38,610 --> 00:29:40,278
Di ikaw ang inaalala ko.

418
00:29:41,362 --> 00:29:44,115
Makinig ka, natutuwa ako kay Richard.
Tito siya ni Jackie,

419
00:29:44,199 --> 00:29:47,285
pero di ibig sabihin
pinagkakatiwalaan ko siya sa rantso natin.

420
00:29:47,786 --> 00:29:49,037
Sa 'kin ka magtiwala.

421
00:29:50,163 --> 00:29:51,164
May tiwala ako sa 'yo.

422
00:29:54,584 --> 00:29:56,753
Sorry kung di ko 'yon naiparamdam sa 'yo.

423
00:30:01,090 --> 00:30:02,133
Salamat sa sinabi mo.

424
00:30:06,221 --> 00:30:07,138
Okay.

425
00:30:08,389 --> 00:30:10,683
Ano ba'ng mali dito sa ginagawa ko?

426
00:30:11,184 --> 00:30:12,519
Well, una…

427
00:30:14,270 --> 00:30:15,522
lahat mali, Will.

428
00:30:17,232 --> 00:30:20,401
Okay, pisilin mo 'yong line.
'Yon ang una mong gawin.

429
00:30:20,485 --> 00:30:22,403
-Okay. Sige.
-Kontrolin mo 'yong line.

430
00:30:29,244 --> 00:30:30,411
Alam ko ang ginagawa mo.

431
00:30:32,247 --> 00:30:34,207
Kinukunan ko 'tong pop-up
para sa newspaper.

432
00:30:34,290 --> 00:30:35,792
Di lang 'yon ang ginagawa mo.

433
00:30:35,875 --> 00:30:38,878
Dinu-document ko 'tong event
as a good journalist.

434
00:31:04,737 --> 00:31:05,822
Cole!

435
00:31:08,408 --> 00:31:09,534
Ano'ng masasabi mo?

436
00:31:11,744 --> 00:31:12,620
Maganda.

437
00:31:14,330 --> 00:31:15,540
Asan ka kagabi?

438
00:31:17,250 --> 00:31:20,670
-Anong meron kagabi?
-Ininvite ni Dylan ang buong team, ah?

439
00:31:23,965 --> 00:31:26,509
Wag kang mag-alala,
walang mahalagang nangyari.

440
00:31:27,302 --> 00:31:28,303
Sige.

441
00:31:30,013 --> 00:31:32,223
Uy! Ang astig nito, di ba?

442
00:31:32,724 --> 00:31:35,602
Nakausap ni Skylar si Mato,
at masaya siya sa sales niya.

443
00:31:35,685 --> 00:31:37,604
Mukhang nag-succeed tayo.

444
00:31:41,441 --> 00:31:42,275
Naku.

445
00:31:46,195 --> 00:31:48,531
Hoy! Ano ba'ng problema mo?

446
00:31:48,615 --> 00:31:52,160
-Relax.
-Wag mo 'kong ma-relax-relax, Ruby.

447
00:31:52,243 --> 00:31:55,246
Ano ba, Jackie? Di naman 'to mahalaga.

448
